# Web

- App Router. Responsive mobile and wide desktop/TV layouts; desktop must not retain a phone-sized shell. Hit targets ≥ 44px, larger for classroom play.
- Vietnamese copy except the English lemma on tiles.
- Vocab audio: `speechSynthesis` (`en-US`), start from a tap.
- No CMS screens here (`apps/admin` owns those).
- Visual language: follow `.cursor/rules/web-duo-vibe.mdc` + `docs/UX.md`. Keep the approved child-friendly colors and controls while allowing desktop content to reflow. Do not change game behavior as part of responsive layout work.
